         <title>CCDASTRO Workflow Manager 1.1.42</title>
         <description>
            <p>Configurable PixInsight post-processing workflow manager.</p>
            <ul>
               <li>v1.1.42 fixes direct native process construction using the workflow&apos;s name-based factory.</li>
               <li>Fixes enumeration lookup for direct native process settings.</li>
